{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0010","text":"公有制经济","bbox":[604.29,89.716,53.753,10.75],"color":"#8e24aa","fontSize":10.75,"block":3,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0011","text":"①内容","bbox":[684.0,39.995,32.251,10.75],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":4,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0012","text":"国有经济、集体经济","bbox":[741.784,39.995,96.754,10.75],"color":"#8e24aa","fontSize":10.75,"block":4,"line":1,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0013","text":"、混合所有制经济中的","bbox":[838.538,39.995,107.505,10.75],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":4,"line":1,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0014","text":"国有成分和集体成分","bbox":[946.043,39.995,96.755,10.75],"color":"#8e24aa","fontSize":10.75,"block":4,"line":1,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0015","text":"②地位","bbox":[684.0,89.716,32.251,10.75],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":5,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0016","text":"公有制主体地位","bbox":[741.784,74.262,75.253,10.75],"color":"#8e24aa","fontSize":10.75,"block":6,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0017","text":"不能动摇，国有经济","bbox":[817.037,74.262,96.754,10.75],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":6,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0018","text":"主导作用","bbox":[913.792,74.262,43.002,10.75],"color":"#8e24aa","fontSize":10.75,"block":6,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0019","text":"不能动摇","bbox":[956.794,74.262,43.002,10.75],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":6,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0020","text":"这是巩固","bbox":[741.784,105.17,43.002,10.75],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":7,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0021","text":"D","bbox":[784.786,101.198,7.267,10.75],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":7,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0022","text":"的执政地位、坚持我国社会主义制度的重要保证","bbox":[792.05,105.17,225.76,10.75],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":7,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0023","text":"③代表","bbox":[684.0,151.532,32.251,10.75],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":8,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0024","text":"国有企业是中国特色社会主义的","bbox":[741.784,136.078,150.507,10.75],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":9,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0025","text":"重要物质基础和政治基础","bbox":[892.291,136.078,118.255,10.75],"color":"#8e24aa","fontSize":10.75,"block":9,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0026","text":"是我们","bbox":[741.784,166.985,32.252,10.75],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":10,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0027","text":"D","bbox":[774.035,163.013,7.267,10.75],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":10,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0028","text":"执政兴国的","bbox":[781.3,166.985,53.752,10.75],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":10,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0029","text":"重要支柱","bbox":[835.053,166.985,43.002,10.75],"color":"#8e24aa","fontSize":10.75,"block":10,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0030","text":"和依靠力量","bbox":[878.055,166.985,53.752,10.75],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":10,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0031","text":"【知识延伸】","bbox":[618.377,236.864,64.503,10.75],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":11,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0032","text":"公有制经济的主体地位","bbox":[708.412,220.738,107.505,10.75],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":12,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0033","text":"主要体现在两个方面","bbox":[708.412,236.864,96.754,10.75],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":12,"line":1,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0034","text":"公有资产在社会总资产中占优势；国有经济控","bbox":[849.513,205.284,215.01,11.353],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":13,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0035","text":"制国民经济的命脉，对经济发展起主导作用","bbox":[849.513,221.41,204.259,10.75],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":13,"line":1,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0036","text":"国有经济起主导作用，集中体现在其对国民经济的控制力上","bbox":[849.513,252.317,279.513,10.751],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":14,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0037","text":"2.","bbox":[597.324,383.346,8.633,10.75],"color":"#ff6f00","fontSize":10.75,"block":15,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0038","text":"非公有制经济","bbox":[605.964,387.37,64.503,10.751],"color":"#ff6f00","fontSize":10.75,"block":15,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0039","text":"①内容","bbox":[696.094,306.742,32.251,10.751],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":16,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0040","text":"包括","bbox":[753.878,290.616,21.501,10.751],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":17,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0041","text":"个体经济、私营经济、港澳台投资经济、外商","bbox":[775.379,290.616,215.01,10.751],"color":"#ff6f00","fontSize":10.75,"block":17,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0042","text":"投资经济以及混合所有制经济中的非公有制成分","bbox":[753.878,306.742,225.76,10.751],"color":"#ff6f00","fontSize":10.75,"block":17,"line":1,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0043","text":"②地位","bbox":[696.094,387.37,32.251,10.751],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":18,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0044","text":"非公有制经济是","bbox":[753.878,341.009,75.253,10.751],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":19,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0045","text":"社会主义市场经济的重要组成部分","bbox":[829.131,341.009,161.257,10.751],"color":"#ff6f00","fontSize":10.75,"block":19,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0046","text":"是国家税收的重要来源，是稳定经济的重要基础","bbox":[753.878,371.917,225.76,10.751],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":20,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0047","text":"是技术创新的重要主体","bbox":[753.878,402.824,107.505,10.751],"color":"#ff6f00","fontSize":10.75,"block":21,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0048","text":"，是就业创业的重要领域","bbox":[861.383,402.824,118.255,10.751],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":21,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0049","text":"是金融发展的重要依托，是经济持续健康发展的重要力量","bbox":[753.878,433.732,268.762,10.751],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":22,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0050","text":"③代表","bbox":[696.094,464.64,32.251,10.751],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":23,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0051","text":"民营经济是非公有制经济的主要形式，是推进中国式现代化的","bbox":[753.878,464.64,290.263,10.751],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":23,"line":1,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0052","text":"生力军","bbox":[1044.141,464.64,32.251,10.751],"color":"#ff6f00","fontSize":10.75,"block":23,"line":1,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0053","text":"二、坚持按劳分配为主","bbox":[456.896,540.901,107.505,10.75],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":24,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0054","text":"体、多种分配方式并存","bbox":[456.896,557.027,107.505,10.75],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":24,"line":1,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0055","text":"在社会主义初级阶段，我国实行的是公有制为主体、多种所有制经济共同发展的所有制","bbox":[602.027,498.907,408.519,10.751],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":25,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0056","text":"这种所有制决定了我国在分配制度上要坚持","bbox":[602.027,529.814,204.259,10.75],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":26,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0057","text":"按劳分配为主体、多种分配方式并存","bbox":[806.287,529.814,172.008,10.75],"color":"#1e88e5","fontSize":10.75,"block":26,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0058","text":"【知识延伸】","bbox":[628.456,599.021,64.503,10.75],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":27,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0059","text":"按生产要素分配","bbox":[623.08,615.146,75.253,10.75],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":27,"line":1,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0060","text":"劳动作为生产要素：主要包括个体劳动者和被雇于非公有制经济的雇佣劳动者的劳动","bbox":[723.866,568.113,397.768,11.191],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":28,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0061","text":"资本类的生产要素：主要包括资本所有者在生产经营活动中凭借资本所取得的利润；","bbox":[723.866,599.021,397.768,11.191],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":29,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0062","text":"生产要素所有者将自有的货币或资本借给他人经营或存入金融机构所取得的利息；","bbox":[723.866,615.146,387.018,11.191],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":29,"line":1,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0063","text":"以实物形态资本租借给他人经营或使用而取得的租金等","bbox":[723.866,631.272,258.012,10.75],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":29,"line":2,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0064","text":"管理和知识产权类的生产要素：主要包括科技发明、创造、信息、专利、数据等参与分配","bbox":[723.866,662.18,419.269,11.191],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":30,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0065","text":"三、构建高水平社会主义市场经济体制","bbox":[456.896,747.512,182.758,10.75],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":31,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0066","text":"1.1992","bbox":[665.186,696.506,30.854,10.751],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":32,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0067","text":"年，","bbox":[696.015,700.478,21.501,10.75],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":32,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0068","text":"D","bbox":[717.522,696.454,7.579,10.75],"color":"#e32c2d","fontSize":10.75,"block":32,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0069","text":"的十四大","bbox":[725.101,700.478,43.002,10.75],"color":"#e32c2d","fontSize":10.75,"block":32,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0070","text":"明确经济体制改革的目标是建立","bbox":[768.103,700.478,150.507,10.75],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":32,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0071","text":"社会主义市场经济体制","bbox":[918.61,700.478,107.505,10.75],"color":"#e32c2d","fontSize":10.75,"block":32,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0072","text":"2.D","bbox":[665.186,727.414,15.169,10.751],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":33,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0073","text":"的十八届三中全会指出，经济体制改革是全面深化改革的重点，核心问题是要","bbox":[680.351,731.386,365.522,10.75],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":33,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0074","text":"处理好","bbox":[665.186,747.512,32.251,10.75],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":33,"line":1,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0075","text":"政府和市场的关系","bbox":[697.438,747.512,86.004,10.75],"color":"#e32c2d","fontSize":10.75,"block":33,"line":1,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0076","text":"，使市场在资源配置中起决定性作用和更好发挥","bbox":[783.442,747.512,225.76,10.75],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":33,"line":1,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0077","text":"政府","bbox":[1009.202,747.512,21.501,10.75],"color":"#e32c2d","fontSize":10.75,"block":33,"line":1,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0078","text":"作用","bbox":[1030.703,747.512,21.501,10.75],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":33,"line":1,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0079","text":"3.","bbox":[665.186,774.447,7.547,10.751],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":34,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0080","text":"要用好","bbox":[672.725,778.419,32.251,10.75],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":34,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0081","text":"“","bbox":[704.976,774.447,3.72,10.751],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":34,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0082","text":"看不见的手","bbox":[708.698,778.419,53.752,10.75],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":34,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0083","text":"”","bbox":[762.45,774.447,3.72,10.751],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":34,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0084","text":"和","bbox":[766.172,778.419,10.75,10.75],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":34,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0085","text":"“","bbox":[776.922,774.447,3.72,10.751],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":34,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0086","text":"看得见的手","bbox":[780.644,778.419,53.752,10.75],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":34,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0087","text":"”","bbox":[834.396,774.447,3.72,10.751],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":34,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0088","text":"，推动","bbox":[838.118,778.419,32.251,10.75],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":34,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0089","text":"有效市场和有为政府","bbox":[870.37,778.419,96.754,10.75],"color":"#e32c2d","fontSize":10.75,"block":34,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0090","text":"更好结合","bbox":[967.124,778.419,43.002,10.75],"color":"#141414","fontSize":10.75,"block":34,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"politics-2-p004-n0091","text":"4","bbox":[592.275,810.923,6.0,16.008],"color":"#000000","fontSize":12.0,"block":35,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"page-number"}],"blocks":[{"id":"politics-2-p004-b0001","text":"第二章分论第三节推动高质量发展","bbox":[47.369,504.443,214.07,12.094],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p004-n0001","politics-2-p004-n0002","politics-2-p004-n0003","politics-2-p004-n0004"]},{"id":"politics-2-p004-b0002","text":"坚持和完善基本经济制度是实现高质量发展的保障","bbox":[309.972,476.062,118.255,26.877],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p004-n0005","politics-2-p004-n0006"]},{"id":"politics-2-p004-b0003","text":"一、公有制为主体、多种所有制经济共同发展","bbox":[456.896,220.738,107.505,26.876],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p004-n0007","politics-2-p004-n0008"]},{"id":"politics-2-p004-b0004","text":"1.公有制经济","bbox":[597.324,85.692,60.719,14.774],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p004-n0009","politics-2-p004-n0010"]},{"id":"politics-2-p004-b0005","text":"①内容国有经济、集体经济、混合所有制经济中的国有成分和集体成分","bbox":[684.0,39.995,358.798,10.75],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p004-n0011","politics-2-p004-n0012","politics-2-p004-n0013","politics-2-p004-n0014"]},{"id":"politics-2-p004-b0006","text":"②地位","bbox":[684.0,89.716,32.251,10.75],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p004-n0015"]},{"id":"politics-2-p004-b0007","text":"公有制主体地位不能动摇，国有经济主导作用不能动摇","bbox":[741.784,74.262,258.012,10.75],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p004-n0016","politics-2-p004-n0017","politics-2-p004-n0018","politics-2-p004-n0019"]},{"id":"politics-2-p004-b0008","text":"这是巩固D的执政地位、坚持我国社会主义制度的重要保证","bbox":[741.784,101.198,276.026,14.722],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p004-n0020","politics-2-p004-n0021","politics-2-p004-n0022"]},{"id":"politics-2-p004-b0009","text":"③代表","bbox":[684.0,151.532,32.251,10.75],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p004-n0023"]},{"id":"politics-2-p004-b0010","text":"国有企业是中国特色社会主义的重要物质基础和政治基础","bbox":[741.784,136.078,268.762,10.75],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p004-n0024","politics-2-p004-n0025"]},{"id":"politics-2-p004-b0011","text":"是我们D执政兴国的重要支柱和依靠力量","bbox":[741.784,163.013,190.023,14.722],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p004-n0026","politics-2-p004-n0027","politics-2-p004-n0028","politics-2-p004-n0029","politics-2-p004-n0030"]},{"id":"politics-2-p004-b0012","text":"【知识延伸】","bbox":[618.377,236.864,64.503,10.75],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p004-n0031"]},{"id":"politics-2-p004-b0013","text":"公有制经济的主体地位主要体现在两个方面","bbox":[708.412,220.738,107.505,26.876],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p004-n0032","politics-2-p004-n0033"]},{"id":"politics-2-p004-b0014","text":"公有资产在社会总资产中占优势；国有经济控制国民经济的命脉，对经济发展起主导作用","bbox":[849.513,205.284,215.01,26.876],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p004-n0034","politics-2-p004-n0035"]},{"id":"politics-2-p004-b0015","text":"国有经济起主导作用，集中体现在其对国民经济的控制力上","bbox":[849.513,252.317,279.513,10.751],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p004-n0036"]},{"id":"politics-2-p004-b0016","text":"2.非公有制经济","bbox":[597.324,383.346,73.143,14.775],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p004-n0037","politics-2-p004-n0038"]},{"id":"politics-2-p004-b0017","text":"①内容","bbox":[696.094,306.742,32.251,10.751],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p004-n0039"]},{"id":"politics-2-p004-b0018","text":"包括个体经济、私营经济、港澳台投资经济、外商投资经济以及混合所有制经济中的非公有制成分","bbox":[753.878,290.616,236.511,26.877],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p004-n0040","politics-2-p004-n0041","politics-2-p004-n0042"]},{"id":"politics-2-p004-b0019","text":"②地位","bbox":[696.094,387.37,32.251,10.751],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p004-n0043"]},{"id":"politics-2-p004-b0020","text":"非公有制经济是社会主义市场经济的重要组成部分","bbox":[753.878,341.009,236.51,10.751],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p004-n0044","politics-2-p004-n0045"]},{"id":"politics-2-p004-b0021","text":"是国家税收的重要来源，是稳定经济的重要基础","bbox":[753.878,371.917,225.76,10.751],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p004-n0046"]},{"id":"politics-2-p004-b0022","text":"是技术创新的重要主体，是就业创业的重要领域","bbox":[753.878,402.824,225.76,10.751],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p004-n0047","politics-2-p004-n0048"]},{"id":"politics-2-p004-b0023","text":"是金融发展的重要依托，是经济持续健康发展的重要力量","bbox":[753.878,433.732,268.762,10.751],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p004-n0049"]},{"id":"politics-2-p004-b0024","text":"③代表民营经济是非公有制经济的主要形式，是推进中国式现代化的生力军","bbox":[696.094,464.64,380.298,10.751],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p004-n0050","politics-2-p004-n0051","politics-2-p004-n0052"]},{"id":"politics-2-p004-b0025","text":"二、坚持按劳分配为主体、多种分配方式并存","bbox":[456.896,540.901,107.505,26.876],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p004-n0053","politics-2-p004-n0054"]},{"id":"politics-2-p004-b0026","text":"在社会主义初级阶段，我国实行的是公有制为主体、多种所有制经济共同发展的所有制","bbox":[602.027,498.907,408.519,10.751],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p004-n0055"]},{"id":"politics-2-p004-b0027","text":"这种所有制决定了我国在分配制度上要坚持按劳分配为主体、多种分配方式并存","bbox":[602.027,529.814,376.268,10.75],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p004-n0056","politics-2-p004-n0057"]},{"id":"politics-2-p004-b0028","text":"【知识延伸】按生产要素分配","bbox":[623.08,599.021,75.253,26.875],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p004-n0058","politics-2-p004-n0059"]},{"id":"politics-2-p004-b0029","text":"劳动作为生产要素：主要包括个体劳动者和被雇于非公有制经济的雇佣劳动者的劳动","bbox":[723.866,568.113,397.768,11.191],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p004-n0060"]},{"id":"politics-2-p004-b0030","text":"资本类的生产要素：主要包括资本所有者在生产经营活动中凭借资本所取得的利润；生产要素所有者将自有的货币或资本借给他人经营或存入金融机构所取得的利息；以实物形态资本租借给他人经营或使用而取得的租金等","bbox":[723.866,599.021,397.768,43.001],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p004-n0061","politics-2-p004-n0062","politics-2-p004-n0063"]},{"id":"politics-2-p004-b0031","text":"管理和知识产权类的生产要素：主要包括科技发明、创造、信息、专利、数据等参与分配","bbox":[723.866,662.18,419.269,11.191],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p004-n0064"]},{"id":"politics-2-p004-b0032","text":"三、构建高水平社会主义市场经济体制","bbox":[456.896,747.512,182.758,10.75],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p004-n0065"]},{"id":"politics-2-p004-b0033","text":"1.1992年，D的十四大明确经济体制改革的目标是建立社会主义市场经济体制","bbox":[665.186,696.454,360.929,14.774],"nodeIds":["poli